          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પરિણામ (pariṇām) is Sanskrit pariṇāma, \"change, outcome\", taken over whole as a tatsama; EtymDB lists it as borrowed from Sanskrit, and CDIAL has no entry for it (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
